1180
01:23:57.002 --> 01:23:59.996
<font color="#F0DC82">[ GROWLING ]</font> <font color="#F0DC82">[ SNARLING ! ]</font>

1181
01:24:02.112 --> 01:24:03.980
<font color="#F0DC82">[ GROWLING ]</font>

1182
